WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
ChatGPT provides a short explanation of training and inference.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Open the / menu and choose Read aloud (Leggi ad alta voce).

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
ChatGPT loads the read-aloud playback.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The active stop control shows that read-aloud playback has started.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
After playback finishes, the Read aloud control is available again.
